  "summary": "EFF interviews Mayday Health's executive director about a Houston billboard campaign warning Texans that ALPR and other surveillance tools can be used to track people seeking abortion care. The campaign follows EFF/404 Media reporting that a Johnson County, TX sheriff searched over 83,000 Flock ALPR cameras to investigate a woman suspected of self-managed abortion.",
  "key_quotes": [
